	)
	(text "Supply undervoltage or a shorted manual contact asserts RESET.\nWatchdog expiry asserts WDO; PM expiry also resets the MCU.\nAON pullups make status readable in the control domain.\nHost rail readiness must also inhibit operation while SYS3V3 is off."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 136.88 0)
