	(text "U2501 supervises the AON-powered MIRA power controller.\nU2502 supervises the SYS3V3 host domain and its heartbeat.\nThese independent monitors feed the permit interlocks so a\nstalled controller or host can inhibit operation without software."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
